      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yosiya ŵaŵilasile acakulungwa wosope ŵa cilambo ca Yuda ni ŵa mu msinda wa Yelusalemu kuti ayice ku nyumba ja ucimwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ni acakulungwawo ŵajawile ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pakwawula ku Nyumbajo, ŵalongene pamo ni ŵakutaga mbopesi ni ŵakulocesya ni ŵandu wosope ŵa cilambo ca Yuda ni ŵa mu msinda wa Yelusalemu, kutandila acakulungwa ni ŵacanandi ŵakwe. Nipo mwenye ŵaŵalasile pameso pawo maloŵe gosope ga m'buku ja cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jijasimanice m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ali amasile kuŵalanga buku ja malanganojo, ŵakwesile pa sanja jakwe, nipo ŵaŵisile cilanga pameso pa AMBUJE kuti takuye matala ga AMBUJEWO, ni kuti tacisunga maloŵe, malamusi ni majiganyo gakwe ni mtima ŵakwe wosope, soni ni umi ŵakwe wosope, ni tacigakamulisya masengo maloŵe gosope ga m'malangano gelega mpela mwele mugalembecele m'bukumo. Myoyo ŵandu wosope nombe nawo ŵajiticisye kugakuya malanganogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mwenye Yosiya ŵamlamwile Hilikiya jwakutaga mbopesi jwamkulungwa, ni soni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵakukamucisya ni alonda ŵapa cipata, kuti atyosye m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE yida yosope yakamulisya masengo pakulambila Baala, Ashela ni ndondwa. Yosiya ni ŵayijocile yida yosopeyo kusa kwa msinda wa Yelusalemu, ku migunda ja ku Kidiloni, nipo liwu lyakwe ŵajawile nalyo ku Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mbi 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo soni ŵatyosisye masengo ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵa milungu ja cilendo, ŵele ŵaŵicidwe ni ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda, kuti apeleceje mbopesi m'misinda ja mcilambo ca Yuda ni malo gakusyungulila Yelusalemu. Ŵatyosisye soni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵaŵatagaga mbopesi kwa Baala, ku lyuŵa, ku mwesi, ku ndondwa ni ku yindu yine yosope yakwinani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatyosisye citela ca cimanyisyo ca mlungu jwakolanjidwa Ashela cicaliji m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ŵajawile naco kusa kwa msinda wa Yelusalemu, ku Ciŵata ca Kidiloni. Kweleko ŵacijocice, ni kucisyaga nipo liwu lyakwe ŵamisile ku malembe ga ŵandu wamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵagumwile tujumba tuŵatamaga ŵandu ŵacalume ŵakutendana ya lilama ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, kumalo giŵalucilaga acakongwe mikanjo jakuwala ŵandu pamkulambila Ashela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yosiya ni ŵayice nawo ku Yelusalemu ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵa ku misinda ja ku Yuda, nipo ŵagajonasile malo gosope gakulambila milungu ja cilendo, giŵatajilaga mbopesi ŵakutaga mbopesiwo, kutandila ku Geba, kumpoto kwa Yelusalemu mpaka ku Belesheba ku mwela kwakwe. Ŵagumwile soni malo gakupelecela mbopesi gosope gagaliji pa cipata ca mlango wa Yoswa, nduna ja msindawo. Malo gelega galiji cakumciji kwa cipata cacikulungwa cakwinjilila mu msindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakutaga mbopesi, ŵaŵatagaga mbopesi kwa milungu jineŵa, nganiŵakunda kutumicila m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, nambo ŵakundile kulya nawo ŵakutaga mbopesi acimjawo, mkate wangali cakusasaŵilisya m'Nyumbamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yosiya ŵagajonasile malo gakolanjidwa kuti Tofeti, malo gigaliji m'Ciŵata ca Benihinomu, kuti mundu jwalijose akampeleka mwanace jwakwe jwamlume kapena jwamkongwe mpela mbopesi jakutinisya kwa mlungu jwakolanjidwa Moleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
