        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatyosisye soni mahaci giŵagapelece ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda mpela mbopesi kwa lyuŵa. Mahacigo ŵagasungaga pa luŵala lwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE, mbali jakuŵandikana ni cipata cakwinjilila ku Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO, ni soni nyumba jiŵatamaga Natani Meleki, jwamkulungwa jwakulolela Nyumbajo. Ni ŵajocice mageleta gaŵakamulisyaga masengo pakulilambila lyuŵa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Mwenye Yosiya ŵagumwile ni kukasanya malo gakupelecela mbopesi gele galiji pa msakasa wa cipinda capenani ca nyumba ja Mwenye Ahasi, gaŵataŵile ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda, pamo ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi gaŵataŵile Mwenye Manase pa maluŵala gaŵili ga Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Yiduswa ya yiŵagumwileyo ŵayijasile m'Ciŵata ca Kidiloni, cicaliji kusa kwa msinda wa Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
