          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya ŵagumwile soni malo gakupelecela mbopesi galiji ku Beteli, giŵataŵile Mwenye Yelobowamu mwanace jwa Nebati, juŵalongolele Aisalaeli kulemwa. Yosiya ŵagumwile malo gakupelecela mbopesigo ni ŵagakasile maganga gakwe, ŵagasyajile mpaka kutenda luwundu, ni soni ŵajocile citela cacimanyisyo ca Ashela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
